145	  # herdr integration: file-based opencode plugin reporting lifecycle state and
146	  # session identity to the local herdr socket while opencode runs in a herdr
147	  # pane. Auto-loaded from ~/.config/opencode/plugins/ (no entry in
148	  # opencode.json's `plugin` array, which is for npm plugins). No-op unless
